the Subaru.
Let's see how it does.

391
00:22:07,980 --> 00:22:11,340
斯巴鲁这下面临巨大挑战了。
冒着青烟弹射起步。
So the Subaru really
is up against it.
Smoking off the line.

392
00:22:11,380 --> 00:22:13,020
-[轮胎尖叫]
-杀向一号弯。
-[TYRES SQUEALING]
-Up to the first corner.

393
00:22:13,060 --> 00:22:15,620
这里推头了，
出师不利啊。
And there's under-steer there,
that's not a good start.

394
00:22:16,940 --> 00:22:19,780
现在进入芝加哥弯，
推头更严重了！
Chicago now,
and more under-steer!

395
00:22:19,820 --> 00:22:21,460
[轮胎尖叫]
[TYRES SQUEALING]

396
00:22:23,380 --> 00:22:25,300
好，现在进锤头弯接受真正考验。
Right, now the real test
through the Hammerhead.

397
00:22:25,340 --> 00:22:27,700
我的天呐！太灾难了！
Oh, my word! That is awful!

398
00:22:27,740 --> 00:22:30,220
翼豹的马力本来
就比Evo少了4匹，
The Impreza already
four horsepower
down on the Evo,

399
00:22:30,260 --> 00:22:32,460
所以操控必须胜过它
才能刷掉那个成绩。
so it's got to out-handle it
to beat its time.

400
00:22:32,500 --> 00:22:34,140
连贯弯过得不错。
Good through
the Follow-through.

401
00:22:34,180 --> 00:22:36,780
噢，瞧瞧那个！
Oh, look at that!

402
00:22:36,820 --> 00:22:40,020
说不定它还能绝地翻盘呢。
Maybe it can pull
something out of the bag.

403
00:22:40,060 --> 00:22:42,700
倒数第二个弯表现好多了，
虽然推头更严重了，
Much better in the
penultimate corner then,
more under-steering,

404
00:22:42,740 --> 00:22:44,700
甘邦弯！
冲线！
Gambon
and across the line!

405
00:22:44,740 --> 00:22:48,540
我还从没在赛道上听哪辆车的胎
叫得这么凄惨过。
I've never heard
so much tyre squeal
from any car out there.

406
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:49,820
可不是嘛。
简直绝了，是不是？
I know.
It was astonishing, wasn't it?

407
00:22:49,860 --> 00:22:51,060
我对这成绩可不抱太大希望。
I'm not expecting a fast time.

408
00:22:51,100 --> 00:22:56,100
确实。成绩是——1分29秒4。
No. Well, it is 1:29.4.

409
00:22:56,140 --> 00:22:57,860
-29？
-29。[轻笑]
-Nine?
-Nine. [CHUCKLES]

410
00:22:57,900 --> 00:23:00,140
-所以，也就比老款快了一丁点。
-确实只有一丁点。
-So, it's only a bit faster
than the old one.
-A bit, yes.

411
00:23:00,180 --> 00:23:01,540
老款是1分30秒……
我们可以把……拿下来了……
Which was 1:30...
We can remove...

412
00:23:01,580 --> 00:23:05,220
而且它居然比老款Evo VIII还要慢，
And it's actually slower
than the old Evo VIII

413
00:23:05,260 --> 00:23:09,220
-就是FQ... 300。
-比……STI慢，是的。
-F, Q... 300.
-B... STI. Yeah.

414
00:23:09,260 --> 00:23:12,620
所以，结论有了。我觉得
斯提格难得金口大开，
居然破天荒挤出了一句话。
So, there we are. I think
The Stig actually got out
one of his rare utterances.

415
00:23:12,660 --> 00:23:15,060
他说斯巴鲁是乖乖仔开的车，
He said that the Subaru
was a good boy's car

416
00:23:15,100 --> 00:23:18,500
而这台三菱，
才是纯爷们儿开的车。
but that, the Mitsubishi,
is a man's car.

417
00:23:18,540 --> 00:23:20,460
看吧？这就对了。
又一个世纪难题解决了。
See? There we go.
Another question answered.

418
00:23:20,500 --> 00:23:22,620
现在我们知道这台车更快，
Now we know
this is the faster car,

419
00:23:22,660 --> 00:23:25,460
因此三菱就是更好的车。
therefore the Mitsubishi
is the better car.

420
00:23:25,500 --> 00:23:28,820
不过话说回来，
你要是觉得Evo快，
Mind you,
if you think the Evo is fast,

421
00:23:28,860 --> 00:23:31,260
那就等瞧瞧我们今晚的嘉宾吧。
wait till you see
our guest tonight.

422
00:23:31,300 --> 00:23:35,780
他大概只要15秒
就能干到147分，
He can do 147 in like,
15 seconds,

423
00:23:35,820 --> 00:23:37,260
而且连车都不用开。
without a car.

424
00:23:37,300 --> 00:23:40,780
因为他就是——
斯诺克世界冠军。
And that's because he is
the World Snooker Champion.

425
00:23:40,820 --> 00:23:43,420
女士们先生们，
罗尼·奥沙利文来了！
Ladies and gentlemen,
Ronnie O'Sullivan is here!

426
00:23:43,460 --> 00:23:45,500
[观众欢呼]
[AUDIENCE CHEERING]

427
00:23:46,740 --> 00:23:50,100
罗尼！
最近怎么样？快请坐。
Ronnie!
How are you? Have a seat.

428
00:23:53,660 --> 00:23:55,260
首先，
First of all,

429
00:23:56,580 --> 00:23:59,580
衷心祝贺你
赢下了那场惊天大胜。
hearty congratulations
on the big win.

430
00:23:59,620 --> 00:24:01,380
-谢谢。
-感觉爽翻了吧？
-Yeah.
-Feel good?

431
00:24:01,420 --> 00:24:03,780
是啊，棒极了。
赢得世界冠军一直是我的梦想。
Yeah, it was great.
It was my dream
to win the world title.

432
00:24:03,820 --> 00:24:05,860
能赢两次就更爽了。
To win it twice
was even better.

433
00:24:05,900 --> 00:24:08,620
太神了。
而且现在大家都在说，
你是有史以来
Fantastic.
And they are saying now
that you're the greatest

434
00:24:08,660 --> 00:24:10,900
最具天赋的斯诺克奇才。
natural talent
at snooker, ever.

435
00:24:11,700 --> 00:24:14,620
-还行吧。
-[观众大笑]
-Yeah.
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

436
00:24:14,660 --> 00:24:19,300
我可是很清楚，
你打小就是个狂热的车迷。
I know for a fact you were
a keen car enthusiast
from an early age.

437
00:24:19,340 --> 00:24:21,620
-没错。
-后来你在斯诺克界崭露头角时，
-Yeah.
-And then when you started
making it in snooker,

438
00:24:21,660 --> 00:24:23,380
他们奖励了你一辆罗孚216。
they gave you a Rover 216.

439
00:24:23,420 --> 00:24:25,500
-对啊。
-[观众大笑]
-Yeah.
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

440
00:24:25,540 --> 00:24:27,260
当时我美滋滋的，
开着可高兴了。
I was chuffed.
I was happy with that.

441
00:24:27,300 --> 00:24:28,980
因为我觉得
这是种绝佳的激励手段。
'Cause I'm thinking
it's an incentive.

442
00:24:29,020 --> 00:24:31,220
我觉得对所有运动员来说，
这主意都挺不错。
I think that's probably
not a bad idea
for all sportsmen.

443
00:24:31,260 --> 00:24:34,460
一人发一辆罗孚，
激励他们好好表现。
Give them a Rover.
It's an incentive
to do better.

444
00:24:34,500 --> 00:24:35,780
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

445
00:24:36,540 --> 00:24:38,260
先开罗孚214，什么时候赢比赛了，
214, start winning,

446
00:24:38,300 --> 00:24:41,260
-什么时候才能买辆像样的车。
-完全正确，没错。
-and you can buy yourself
a decent car.
-Exactly, yeah.

447
00:24:41,300 --> 00:24:43,620
所以你出成绩之后，
你买的第一辆车是什么？
So you got going
and your first car was what

448
00:24:43,660 --> 00:24:45,140
当你真正开始……
when you really started...

449
00:24:45,180 --> 00:24:47,060
是一辆宝马318i。
It was a BMW 318i.

450
00:24:47,540 --> 00:24:49,500
-318？
-对。
-318?
-Yeah.

451
00:24:49,540 --> 00:24:51,700
-天呐。
-[笑声]
-Oh, dear.
-[LAUGHING]

452
00:24:51,740 --> 00:24:52,980
你给撞了？
Did you crash it?

453
00:24:53,020 --> 00:24:56,300
额，对，撞了。
但那全赖警察。
Uh, yeah, I did.
It was the police's fault.

454
00:24:56,340 --> 00:24:58,380
-真的假的？
-因为他们一直在后面咬着我，
-Was it really?
-'Cause they were following me

455
00:24:58,420 --> 00:25:00,380
我知道他们要逼停我，
可他们就一直死跟着。
and I knew they was going to
pull me over, but they
just kept following me.

456
00:25:00,420 --> 00:25:02,460
我就一直盯着后视镜看，
准备右转的时候，
And I just kept looking in
my mirror and I went
to turn right,

457
00:25:02,500 --> 00:25:05,020
根本没看前面
对向开过来的车。
but I wasn't looking forward
at what was
coming the other way.

458
00:25:06,020 --> 00:25:07,740
好吧，算我有罪。
So, I was guilty, yeah.

459
00:25:07,780 --> 00:25:10,260
你是不是还把车撞进过酒店前台？
Didn't you once crash a car
into a hotel reception?

460
00:25:10,300 --> 00:25:12,580
对，在布莱克浦。
Yeah. It was in Blackpool.

461
00:25:12,620 --> 00:25:14,220
当时我们住在那家挺不错的酒店。
We were staying
in this nice hotel.

462
00:25:14,260 --> 00:25:18,340
我顺着引道开上去，
车速稍微快了那么一点，
I was driving up the driveway
and I was just, a bit too fast

463
00:25:18,380 --> 00:25:20,460
结果一头撞穿了大堂前台。
and I ended up
going through the reception.

464
00:25:20,500 --> 00:25:22,340
-直接怼进去了。
-[观众笑声]
-Sort of ran into it.
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

465
00:25:22,380 --> 00:25:24,700
那你现在开什么车？
宝马都让你给撞烂了吧？
So, what do you drive
now then? Now
you've smashed you BMWs up?

466
00:25:24,740 --> 00:25:26,580
额，我有一辆奔驰和一辆宾利。
Um, I've got a Mercedes
and a Bentley.

467
00:25:26,620 --> 00:25:29,580
-奔驰哪款……
-500SL。
-A Mercedes...
-500SL.

468
00:25:29,620 --> 00:25:31,500
-500？
-我知道你想说什么。
-A 500?
-I know.

469
00:25:31,540 --> 00:25:33,260
-哎呀，我的老天。
-我知道。
-Oh, dear.
-I know.

470
00:25:33,300 --> 00:25:34,580
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

471
00:25:34,620 --> 00:25:37,380
堂堂世界冠军，
你就只买了台500？
A World Champion
and you've only
bought the 500?

472
00:25:37,420 --> 00:25:40,460
它一直给我带来好运，所以我……
我舍不得把它卖掉。
It's been lucky for me so
that's why I'm...
I don't want to get rid of it.

473
00:25:40,500 --> 00:25:42,900
-但这车也太肉了。
-[罗尼大笑]
-But it's a bit wet.
-[RONNIE LAUGHS]

474
00:25:42,940 --> 00:25:44,820
挺好的，够我开了。
It's all right, it does me.

475
00:25:44,860 --> 00:25:46,460
-它根本跑不动好吗！你还不如……
-我确实得换辆新的了。
-It barely moves!
You might as well...
-I'll have to get a new one.

476
00:25:46,500 --> 00:25:49,660
……弄把扶手椅，
让你妈推着你到处转悠呢。
...get an armchair and
get your mum
to push you around in it.

477
00:25:49,700 --> 00:25:51,980
反正速度没差。
去换辆55啊！
It's the same thing.
Get a 55!

478
00:25:52,020 --> 00:25:54,100
-所以你还有辆宾利？
-GT那款。
-So you got Bentley as well?
-The GT one.

479
00:25:54,140 --> 00:25:56,060
-哦，欧陆GT。
-那辆真挺棒的。
-Oh, the Continental.
-That's really nice.

480
00:25:56,100 --> 00:25:57,380
-你喜欢那辆？
-我挺喜欢开它的。
-You like that?
-I like driving that.

481
00:25:57,420 --> 00:25:58,700
你不觉得这车一股
大众味吗？
Don't you think it's a bit
of a Volkswagen?

482
00:25:58,740 --> 00:25:59,980
-不觉得。
-真的假的？
-Nah.
-Really?

483
00:26:00,020 --> 00:26:01,340
-没觉得。
-明明就是。
-Nah.
-It is.

484
00:26:01,380 --> 00:26:02,620
-是吗？
-当然了。
-Is it?
-Yeah.

485
00:26:02,660 --> 00:26:04,660
那照这么说，阿斯顿·马丁还都是福特呢，
不是吗？
Well, Aston's are Fords,
aren't they?

486
00:26:04,700 --> 00:26:05,940
话是没错。但你瞧见那台DB9了吗？
Yeah. Have you seen the DB9?

487
00:26:05,980 --> 00:26:07,540
见过了，我见过DB9。确实很棒。
Yeah, I've seen the DB9. Yeah.

488
00:26:07,580 --> 00:26:10,260
-那你觉得……
-太迷人了。
-And you think...
-It's a lovely car.

489
00:26:10,300 --> 00:26:11,980
-确实漂亮。
-打算提一台吗？
-Very nice.
-Gonna get one?

490
00:26:12,020 --> 00:26:14,660
呃，我妈……
她管我花钱
管得有点严……
Uh, my mum...
She's a bit strict
on me spending...

491
00:26:15,380 --> 00:26:16,860
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

492
00:26:17,700 --> 00:26:19,620
真管得严。
She is.

493
00:26:19,660 --> 00:26:22,060
-你手上握着一项世界纪录对吧，就是……
-最快单杆147分。
-You've got the world record,
haven't you, for...
-The fastest 147.

494
00:26:22,100 --> 00:26:23,460
最快单杆打出147满分。
The fastest 147.

495
00:26:23,500 --> 00:26:25,580
-当时用了多久来着？
-嗯，5分20秒。
-Which was how long?
-Mmm. 5:20.

496
00:26:25,620 --> 00:26:27,140
那一把的奖金也相当丰厚吧，
不是吗？
Big prize money as well
for that, wasn't it?

497
00:26:27,180 --> 00:26:29,620
呃，大概十七万英镑。
Uh, about 170 grand.

498
00:26:29,660 --> 00:26:31,100
就为了这5分20秒？
[轻笑]
For 5:20?
[CHUCKLES]

499
00:26:33,620 --> 00:26:36,420
换我立马就去买台DB9了。
说真的，
我肯定拔腿就去……
I'd go and buy a DB9.
Honestly.
I'll just go straight...

500
00:26:36,460 --> 00:26:38,620
回头花个5分50秒
再去打一把。
Do it again in about
5:50.

501
00:26:38,660 --> 00:26:41,460
那……重点就在这儿了，
要是你再次打破纪录，
他们还会再发你一次这笔奖金吗？
Do you... That's the point,
will they pay you that again
if you beat it again?

502
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:43,500
呃……会啊，之后我还拿过。
Uh... Yeah, I've had it since.

503
00:26:43,540 --> 00:26:44,620
换我我就天天去刷一把。
I'd just do it every day.

504
00:26:45,580 --> 00:26:47,300
呃，言归正传……
Um, now...

505
00:26:47,340 --> 00:26:48,940
我猜你肯定一直盼着……
I guess you've been looking...

506
00:26:48,980 --> 00:26:51,100
因为你特意取消了休假
跑来录这期节目，对吧？
'Cause you cancelled
your holiday to come
and do this, didn't you?

507
00:26:51,140 --> 00:26:54,100
-呃，差不多算吧，确实。
-瞧见没？
-Well, sort of, yeah.
-You see?

508
00:26:54,140 --> 00:26:56,660
这位是真迫不及待想来跑两圈过过瘾。
He's a bit keen to come
and give this one a whirl.

509
00:26:56,700 --> 00:26:59,500
我们节目每周都有这么个习惯，
We have this thing
on the show, every week,

510
00:26:59,540 --> 00:27:03,100
会专门列个榜单，统计嘉宾到底能迟到多久。
where we keep a chart
for how late our guest is.

511
00:27:03,140 --> 00:27:05,180
就是“开廉价车的明星”环节。
The star
in a Reasonably Priced Car.

512
00:27:05,220 --> 00:27:07,540
此前的纪录保持者是西蒙·考威尔，知道吧？
Currently, it was
Simon Cowell, okay?

513
00:27:07,580 --> 00:27:08,980
他足足迟到了1小时15分钟。
He was 1 hour 15 minutes late.

514
00:27:09,020 --> 00:27:13,340
结果乔丹一举将纪录秒杀，
整整迟到了2个小时。
Jordan blew that away.
A full 2 hours late.

515
00:27:13,380 --> 00:27:16,740
而眼前这位老兄，居然比约定时间
提前了四个小时杀到现场！
This guy rocked up four hours
before being asked to!

516
00:27:16,780 --> 00:27:19,020
-[大笑]
-提早了整整四个小时！
-[LAUGHING]
-Four hours early!

517
00:27:23,340 --> 00:27:24,940
所以你真是个不折不扣的大车迷。
So you are a pretty
keen car person.

518
00:27:24,980 --> 00:27:27,020
可把我乐坏了，
我简直一秒钟都等不及要赶过来。
I was made up.
I couldn't wait to get here.

519
00:27:27,060 --> 00:27:28,580
我昨晚差点就直接杀过来了！
I was gonna come down
last night!

520
00:27:28,620 --> 00:27:30,820
[观众笑声]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

521
00:27:30,860 --> 00:27:32,580
谁想看这一圈？
Who'd like to see the lap?

522
00:27:32,620 --> 00:27:33,780
-想看吗？
-观众：想！
-Yeah?
-AUDIENCE: Yes!

523
00:27:33,820 --> 00:27:35,500
好，这就来。
咱们来瞧瞧。
Okay, here we go.
Let's have a look.

524
00:27:35,540 --> 00:27:37,500
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECHING]

525
00:27:37,540 --> 00:27:39,700
行啊，你烧胎打滑滑出去的距离
比谁都要长。
Well, you've managed to make
that thing wheelspin further
than anyone else.

526
00:27:39,740 --> 00:27:42,580
[轮胎剧烈摩擦声]
[TYRES SQUEALING]

527
00:27:42,620 --> 00:27:44,540
不得不说，罗尼，
跑得真不错。
Gotta say, Ronnie,
that's very good.

528
00:27:44,580 --> 00:27:46,860
过那段路
相当漂亮。
That's very, very good
through there.

529
00:27:46,900 --> 00:27:48,900
再来看看这里。
快切线时有点推头。
Now let's have a look.
Under-steer close to the line.

530
00:27:48,940 --> 00:27:50,740
克拉克森：哎哟，
