这是保时捷有史以来最令人兴奋、
最帅气、
最昂贵，
This is the most exciting,
the best looking,
the most expensive,

947
00:49:11,740 --> 00:49:16,220
并且速度最快的公路量产跑车。
and the fastest road-going
Porsche ever made.

948
00:49:19,620 --> 00:49:23,540
它叫Carrera GT。
It's called the Carrera GT.

949
00:49:23,580 --> 00:49:27,820
而我打算先从
德国人的视角
来审视它。
And I'm going to start
by looking at it
from a German's point of view.

950
00:49:29,220 --> 00:49:30,660
这挺有意思。
This is interesting.

951
00:49:30,700 --> 00:49:36,820
曲轴距离车底地板
只有98.5毫米。
The crank is only 98.5mm
from the floor of the car.

952
00:49:36,860 --> 00:49:38,820
曲轴之所以能放得这么低，
The reason
why the crank is so low

953
00:49:38,860 --> 00:49:42,020
是因为我手里拿的这个离合器，
体积实在是太小了。
is because the clutch,
which I have here,
is so small.

954
00:49:42,060 --> 00:49:46,820
它有两个摩擦片，
由碳纤维
和碳化硅制成。
It's got two plates
made from carbon fibre
and silicon carbide.

955
00:49:47,740 --> 00:49:50,100
噢——！
Ooh!

956
00:49:50,140 --> 00:49:53,220
抱歉，我一说“碳化硅”
偶尔就会起这种反应。
Sorry, that happens sometimes
when I say silicon carbide.

957
00:49:53,260 --> 00:49:54,700
噢——！
Ooh!

958
00:49:54,740 --> 00:49:57,820
呃，言归正传，我们来看看
它到底有多重。
Uh, anyway, let's see
how much it weighs.

959
00:49:57,860 --> 00:50:00,180
把它放到我们这边的秤上。
Pop it in the scales
that we have here.

960
00:50:00,220 --> 00:50:02,860
我们还准备了些白糖。
这是两包。
And we've got some sugar.
There's two bags.

961
00:50:04,380 --> 00:50:05,780
三袋。
Three bags.

962
00:50:05,820 --> 00:50:09,380
第四袋放上去。
瞧瞧这个！
And four bags.
Look at that!

963
00:50:09,420 --> 00:50:11,780
还没四袋白糖重呢。
Less than four bags of sugar.

964
00:50:11,820 --> 00:50:18,260
【大喊】我现在是在车底的
文丘里扩散通道里
跟你们说话。
[LOUDLY] I'm speaking to you
now from inside one
of the Venturi tunnels.

965
00:50:18,300 --> 00:50:22,060
我手里拿的这个
是一个刹车盘的剖面样品，
And what I have here
is a cut-away
of one of the brakes,

966
00:50:22,100 --> 00:50:26,980
同样轻得不可思议，
因为它是用
【结巴】碳化硅做的。
also very light
because it's made from
[STAMMERING] silicon carbide.

967
00:50:27,580 --> 00:50:29,100
噢！
Ooh!

968
00:50:29,140 --> 00:50:30,620
哇噢！
Ooh!

969
00:50:31,860 --> 00:50:33,060
【倒吸一口凉气】
[GASPS]

970
00:50:37,220 --> 00:50:40,060
换作是个德国人，到这会儿从厕所出来，
At this point, a German would
come out of the lavatory,

971
00:50:40,100 --> 00:50:43,420
肯定会说“一切完美无瑕”，
然后就完事了。
say everything's perfect
and move on.

972
00:50:43,460 --> 00:50:45,220
但我可不是德国人。
But I'm not German.

973
00:50:45,260 --> 00:50:48,340
所以咱们还是用英国人的视角来瞧瞧吧。
So let's look at it
from a British point of view.

974
00:50:49,140 --> 00:50:50,740
【引擎轰鸣】
[ENGINE ROARING]

975
00:50:59,940 --> 00:51:01,820
哇吼！
Whoa!

976
00:51:03,980 --> 00:51:06,220
【狂喜大笑】
[LAUGHS ECSTATICALLY]

977
00:51:09,980 --> 00:51:14,420
我浑身上下
全都起鸡皮疙瘩了！
I am just a mass
of goose pimples!

978
00:51:14,460 --> 00:51:18,700
我以前从没体会过这种感觉。
从来没有过！
I've never had a feeling
like this before. I've never
felt anything like that!

979
00:51:25,700 --> 00:51:27,620
听听这引擎声！
Listen to that engine!

980
00:51:28,460 --> 00:51:29,460
【引擎咆哮】
[ROARS]

981
00:51:30,340 --> 00:51:33,260
这是一台5.7升的V10！
It's a 5.7-litre V10!

982
00:51:34,820 --> 00:51:37,380
原本是专为赛道设计的。
Originally designed
for racing.

983
00:51:37,420 --> 00:51:40,940
但现在它被塞进了一台公路车里，
这带来的效果
But now it's in a road car
and the effect

984
00:51:40,980 --> 00:51:44,100
简直让人灵魂出窍！
is absolutely mind-blowing!

985
00:51:46,220 --> 00:51:48,900
它的性能数据简直称得上神迹。
The performance figures
really are biblical.

986
00:51:48,940 --> 00:51:51,740
你能压榨出整整612匹制动马力。
You get 612 brake horsepower.

987
00:51:51,780 --> 00:51:55,500
这意味着零百加速（0-60英里/小时）
只要3.9秒。
And that means naught to 60
in 3.9 seconds.

988
00:51:59,740 --> 00:52:02,940
油门踩到底，你能飙到时速205英里（约330公里）。
Flat out, you'll be doing 205.

989
00:52:05,580 --> 00:52:09,300
即便是那些最快、
最顶级的超级跑车，
Even in the fastest,
most exotic cars,

990
00:52:09,340 --> 00:52:10,860
到了某个节点，动力
there's a point
where the power

991
00:52:10,900 --> 00:52:14,340
也会在与空气阻力的死磕中败下阵来。
starts to lose its battle
with the friction of the air.

992
00:52:14,380 --> 00:52:15,500
但在这台车上……
But in this...

993
00:52:18,260 --> 00:52:19,500
动力完全没有任何衰减！
There's no let-up at all!

994
00:52:21,460 --> 00:52:23,380
就像是在真空里狂奔一样。
It's like
it's moving in a vacuum.

995
00:52:24,620 --> 00:52:28,580
120、130、140、150……
120, 130, 140, 150...

996
00:52:28,620 --> 00:52:30,140
它根本就没有要停下来的意思！
It just isn't gonna stop!

997
00:52:34,500 --> 00:52:36,580
它不仅是我开过
Not only is it
one of the fastest

998
00:52:36,620 --> 00:52:38,860
速度最快、最刺激的车之一，
and most exciting cars
I've ever driven,

999
00:52:38,900 --> 00:52:41,940
而且还是最赏心悦目的尤物之一。
it is also one of the
most beautiful.

1000
00:52:47,060 --> 00:52:50,820
它的造型设计并不具备法拉利
或是兰博基尼那种奔放与激情。
It isn't styled
with the verve or the passion
of a Ferrari or a Lamborghini.

1001
00:52:50,860 --> 00:52:55,060
它的外形，每一个部件、每一处细节
都恪守着形式服从功能的法则，
Its form, following function
in every piece, every detail,

1002
00:52:55,100 --> 00:52:59,740
精准得就像德国的火车时刻表一样，
分秒不差，严丝合缝。
is as precise
and as perfect
as Germany's rail timetable.

1003
00:53:02,620 --> 00:53:05,740
说真的，这世上能拿来跟它相提并论的，
其实只有一辆车。
Really there's only one car
this can be compared with.

1004
00:53:05,780 --> 00:53:09,300
那就是我们两周前测过的那台
迈凯伦梅赛德斯SLR。
The McLaren Mercedes SLR
we tested two weeks ago.

1005
00:53:10,660 --> 00:53:13,540
两台身价都超过了30万英镑，
They both cost
more than £300,000,

1006
00:53:13,580 --> 00:53:17,580
而且都能榨出超过600匹的制动马力。
and they both produce
more than
600 brake horsepower.

1007
00:53:17,620 --> 00:53:19,580
但两者之间，
有着一个致命的区别。
But there is
a crucial difference.

1008
00:53:21,660 --> 00:53:23,420
那台奔驰，
The Mercedes,

1009
00:53:23,460 --> 00:53:26,300
是台GT跑车，后备厢巨大，
铺着厚实的地毯，
that's a GT car,
it's got a big boot,
it's got thick carpets,

1010
00:53:26,340 --> 00:53:28,700
还塞满了各种奢华的舒适配置。
it's got lots of
luxury equipment.

1011
00:53:28,740 --> 00:53:31,380
但眼前这台，
可纯粹、硬核多了。
This, though,
much more focused.

1012
00:53:31,420 --> 00:53:34,820
这儿全是碳纤维，传动通道是镁合金的。
Carbon fibre here. A magnesium
transmission tunnel.

1013
00:53:34,860 --> 00:53:36,620
挡把干脆就是个简简单单的山毛榉木头。
A simple beech wood
gear lever.

1014
00:53:38,540 --> 00:53:40,940
这才是返璞归真的“不插电”超跑。
This is a supercar unplugged.

1015
00:53:44,780 --> 00:53:48,180
正因如此，它比迈凯伦轻得多，
As a result, it's much lighter
than the McLaren,

1016
00:53:48,220 --> 00:53:50,540
身手更加灵动，也更加锋芒毕露。
and that makes it nimbler
and edgier.

1017
00:53:50,580 --> 00:53:54,060
但这也意味着——它更难驯服。
And that makes it
more of a handful.

1018
00:53:54,100 --> 00:53:55,420
[轮胎尖叫声]
[TYRES SCREECHING]

1019
00:53:57,180 --> 00:53:59,540
哇！哇！慢点！慢点！
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!

1020
00:53:59,580 --> 00:54:03,540
想把它开这么快，
你的脑子必须打起十二分精神！
You need to be awake
to drive this fast!

1021
00:54:03,580 --> 00:54:07,500
这车真的一点都不好掌控，
离合沉重又粗暴，
It really isn't
an easy car to control.
The clutch is brutal.

1022
00:54:07,540 --> 00:54:09,860
动力凶狠得像头野兽，至于操控……
The power is savage.
And the handling...

1023
00:54:09,900 --> 00:54:12,140
你简直就是在刀尖上跳舞。
You really are
on a knife edge.

1024
00:54:12,180 --> 00:54:14,620
可只要你肯拼上全力去驾驭它，
But if you put in the effort,

1025
00:54:15,940 --> 00:54:18,980
哎呀老天，那爽快感绝对值回票价！
boy, oh, boy,
do you get the rewards.

1026
00:54:25,940 --> 00:54:30,180
你真得长两个脑子，
才能跟上这台机械猛兽的节奏！
You really need two brains
just to keep up with
all the machinery in here!

1027
00:54:45,860 --> 00:54:48,620
平时我更钟情英国车和意大利车，
Normally, I like
British and Italian cars

1028
00:54:48,660 --> 00:54:52,140
因为它们身上有满满的灵魂与个性。
because they have
so much soul and character.

1029
00:54:52,180 --> 00:54:57,540
而德国车，我总觉得
工程功底极其深厚，激情却略显欠缺。
German cars I always find
are long on engineering
but a bit short on passion.

1030
00:54:57,580 --> 00:54:59,100
但这台车……
This, though...

1031
00:55:00,300 --> 00:55:01,580
我的天呐！
My God!

1032
00:55:04,380 --> 00:55:06,700
真有那么神？真的假的？
It's that good? Really?

1033
00:55:06,740 --> 00:55:10,620
简直是个奇迹。说真的，
好到让人头皮发麻。
It is a phenomenon. Honestly,
mind-blowingly good.

1034
00:55:10,660 --> 00:55:14,660
所以我很期待它能干掉迈凯伦奔驰，
So, I'm expecting it to beat
the McLaren Mercedes,

1035
00:55:14,700 --> 00:55:17,220
那台车目前当然雄踞圈速榜榜首，
1分20秒9。
which is at
the top of the board
of course. 1:20.9.

1036
00:55:17,260 --> 00:55:19,140
两台车马力平起平坐，
Because they've both
got the same power,

1037
00:55:19,180 --> 00:55:23,140
但这台保时捷足足轻了240公斤，
这差距可太要命了。
but the Porsche
is 240 kilos lighter,
which is a lot.

1038
00:55:23,180 --> 00:55:28,100
不过问题是，
那台迈凯伦奔驰开起来轻轻松松。
Thing is, though.
That McLaren Mercedes
is easy to drive.

1039
00:55:28,140 --> 00:55:31,620
自动挡，
油门随便一踩就能飞快，毫无门槛。
Automatic.
You can go very, very fast
and it's not difficult.

1040
00:55:31,660 --> 00:55:33,540
至于这台保时捷……[轻笑]
The Porsche... [CHUCKLES]

1041
00:55:33,580 --> 00:55:35,140
这么说吧，
你们都知道斯提格对吧？
Well, put it this way.
You know The Stig, right?

1042
00:55:35,180 --> 00:55:36,700
-控车技术出神入化。
-那可不。
-Mighty car control.
-Oh, yes.

1043
00:55:36,740 --> 00:55:39,060
他钻进那辆保时捷，
心想：“行，看我的。”
He got into that Porsche.
"Right, here we go."

1044
00:55:39,100 --> 00:55:42,500
我们其实录了盘带子，
正好可以放给大家看看
他第一次试跑的样子。
And we've actually got a tape,
which I think we can show you,
of his first attempt.

1045
00:55:42,540 --> 00:55:44,260
在哪呢？看大屏幕。
Where's that? Look.

1046
00:55:44,300 --> 00:55:46,420
他过来了，
正在进锤头弯。
Here he comes
into the Hammerhead.

1047
00:55:46,460 --> 00:55:48,980
贴着轮胎墙非常近，然后……
Very close
to the tyres and...

1048
00:55:49,020 --> 00:55:50,940
-讲真，这车简直是个混蛋。
-根本就是头怪兽。
-Honestly. It's a pig.
-It's a monster.

1049
00:55:50,980 --> 00:55:52,780
奔驰还会包容你的失误。
The Mercedes forgives you.

1050
00:55:52,820 --> 00:55:55,660
而那玩意儿，敢犯一点错……
它能直接把你脑袋咬下来。
就这么直接。
That, make a mistake...
It bites your head off.
It's that simple.

1051
00:55:55,700 --> 00:55:58,540
之后他又试了一次，
又打滑转圈，
转了一次、又一次、再一次。
He had another go after that,
spun it again,
and again, and again.

1052
00:55:58,580 --> 00:56:01,660
但在练了整整
一上午之后，
But then, after a whole
morning's practising,

1053
00:56:01,700 --> 00:56:04,660
他终于准备好
去挑战那辆奔驰了。
he was ready
to take on the Mercedes.

1054
00:56:06,380 --> 00:56:08,620
好了，重头戏来了！
Okay, this is the big one.

1055
00:56:08,660 --> 00:56:11,220
起步疯狂打滑烧胎，
直奔一号弯！
Masses of wheel spin
off the line,
down to the first corner.

1056
00:56:11,260 --> 00:56:12,780
他必须如履薄冰。
He has got to tread carefully.

1057
00:56:12,820 --> 00:56:16,780
他心里清楚，那颗
巨大的V10地雷随时会反咬一口。
He knows that that
big V10 landmine will bite.

1058
00:56:17,540 --> 00:56:19,460
[正播放热血摇滚情歌]
[POWER BALLAD PLAYING]

1059
00:56:21,980 --> 00:56:24,860
我很惊讶他今天
居然还在听
他那些激昂情歌，
I am actually surprised
he's playing
his power ballads today,

1060
00:56:24,900 --> 00:56:28,020
因为说实话，他得……
看他过芝加哥弯！
because, really, he has...
Look at that through Chicago.

1061
00:56:28,060 --> 00:56:30,460
轻给油门，
绝不能失控。
Gently on the power,
doesn't wanna lose it.

1062
00:56:30,500 --> 00:56:31,980
他可真的是一点都不能失控。
He really doesn't
want to lose it.

1063
00:56:32,020 --> 00:56:33,900
车尾摆了一下，稳住了，
正在逼近锤头弯。
Bit of a wiggle. He's okay,
coming up to the Hammerhead.

1064
00:56:33,940 --> 00:56:35,340
刚才他就是在这儿打转的。
This is where
he spun it before.

1065
00:56:35,380 --> 00:56:37,820
现在容不得半点闪失。
Cannot afford a mistake now.

1066
00:56:37,860 --> 00:56:41,420
在这个节点上，他的节奏
已经落后于SLR了，但是现在……
He's already off
the SLR's pace
at this point, but now...

1067
00:56:43,500 --> 00:56:45,580
全面开启狂攻模式！
This is maximum attack mode.

1068
00:56:45,620 --> 00:56:47,340
油门彻底轰开到底了，
He's really
opening the taps now,

1069
00:56:47,380 --> 00:56:49,580
疯狂操弄着那台手动变速箱，
really, really working
that manual gearbox,

1070
00:56:49,620 --> 00:56:53,100
誓要把对自动挡迈凯伦的
每一毫秒优势
都给狠狠榨出来！
wringing out
every millisecond advantage
over the automatic McLaren.

1071
00:56:53,140 --> 00:56:55,580
来到倒数第二个弯，
重踩碳陶刹车！
This is the second
to last bend.
Hard on the ceramic brakes.

1072
00:56:55,620 --> 00:56:58,940
稳住！
他小心拿捏着动力输出。
甘榜弯！
Keep it steady.
He's measuring out the power.
Gambon corner.

1073
00:56:58,980 --> 00:57:01,420
全力冲刺了！
冲线！
He's pushing it now!
And there he is!

1074
00:57:01,460 --> 00:57:05,700
-好的，迈凯伦奔驰的
成绩是1分20秒9。
-对，我们知道。
-Okay, the McLaren Mercedes
did it in 1:20.9.
-Yes. We know that.

1075
00:57:05,740 --> 00:57:08,060
-继续。
-相比榜上其他车，这成绩已经飞快了。
-Go on.
-Which is pretty fast
compared to all the others.

1076
00:57:08,100 --> 00:57:11,380
-那么保时捷呢？成绩在我手里。
-快念！结果是……漂亮！
-Yes? Porsche. Got it here.
-Yes. And... Yes!

1077
00:57:11,420 --> 00:57:13,660
-1分19秒8！
-[观众欢呼]
-1:19.8!
-[AUDIENCE CHEERING]

1078
00:57:13,700 --> 00:57:15,740
[口哨声]
[WHISTLING]

1079
00:57:15,780 --> 00:57:17,740
这是我们测过最快的车。
Fastest car we've ever had.

1080
00:57:21,020 --> 00:57:22,340
然而……
However...

1081
00:57:24,060 --> 00:57:26,140
先别高兴得太早。
Don't get too excited.

1082
00:57:26,180 --> 00:57:29,820
别高兴得太早，
因为下周，
大英帝国就要发起反击了。
Don't get too excited,
because next week
Britain fights back.

1083
00:57:29,860 --> 00:57:32,260
-我们要把这台罗孚弄来！
-[观众笑声]
-We've got this Rover coming!
-[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

